#
Inside the tunnel.
*
INDOOR_DARK
*
ICAVE
*
You can make out the exit of this tunnel to the south.
Your peeks northward drown in darkness.
#
Bend in the tunnel.
*
INDOOR_DARK
*
ICAVE
*
The tunnel bends from north to east here. The walls are covered
by the omnipresent.
*
add_monster( "spider_phase",1 );
#
Dead end.
*
INDOOR_DARK
*
ICAVE
*
You reached a dead end. Probably this is a good time to return
to where you came from.
*
add_monster( "spider_phase",1 );
#
A tunnel.
*
INDOOR_DARK
*
ICAVE
*
The spiderwebs seem to get less on your way east. Also you hear
the roaring sound of water comming from the east.
#
Inside the crack
*
INDOOR_DARK
*
ICAVE
*
The crack narrows so your way any further is blocked.
*
add_monster( "spider_phase",1 );
#
Inside the mountain.
*
INDOOR_DARK
*
ICAVE
*
You get a bit claustrophobic with all the rock above you.
The spiderwebs on the walls are not calming your uneasy
feelings neither.
#
Dark tunnel.
*
INDOOR_DARK
*
ICAVE
*
The tunnel is dark and gloomy. A light fresh breeze tickles
#
Intersection.
*
INDOOR_DARK
*
ICAVE
*
Tunnels lead further into the mountain. All walls are
covered by spiderwebs. You hear the clicking of insect feet on
rock.
#
Twist in the tunnel.
*
INDOOR_DARK
*
ICAVE
*
A large crack in the wall lets the tunnel twist here.
The walls there are covered over and over with spiderwebs.
*
add_desc( "spiderwebs","The insects that built this webs must have been "+
          "of enormous size.\n" );
*
add_monster( "spider_phase",1 );
#
Which way to go.
*
INDOOR_DARK
*
ICAVE
*
Tunnels open to all directions, but all look quite the same:
dark rocky walls covered by spiderwebs.
*
add_monster( "spider_phase",1 );
